### There is no "create card" endpoint yet (cards are provisioned by Phase 6 seeding).
### To try these requests against a running card-service backed by docker-compose Postgres,
### seed one row first, e.g.:
###
### docker exec -it novabank-postgres psql -U novabank -d card_db -c "
###   INSERT INTO cards (id, customer_id, linked_account_id, type, scheme, masked_pan, last4,
###                       expiry_month, expiry_year, status, daily_limit, currency, block_reason)
###   VALUES ('77777777-7777-7777-7777-777777777777', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222',
###           '11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111', 'DEBIT', 'VISA', '4111 **** **** 1234', '1234',
###           12, 2029, 'ACTIVE', 5000.00, 'AED', NULL);
### "

### List a customer's cards
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/customers/22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222/cards

### Get one card (masked PAN only - the full PAN is never stored or returned)
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/customers/22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222/cards/77777777-7777-7777-7777-777777777777

### Ownership check: wrong customer id returns 404
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/customers/99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999/cards/77777777-7777-7777-7777-777777777777

### Block the card - requires a reason
POST http://localhost:8083/api/v1/customers/22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222/cards/77777777-7777-7777-7777-777777777777/block
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Reported lost by customer"
}

### Blocking an already-blocked card fails with 422
POST http://localhost:8083/api/v1/customers/22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222/cards/77777777-7777-7777-7777-777777777777/block
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Second attempt"
}

### Unblock the card
POST http://localhost:8083/api/v1/customers/22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222/cards/77777777-7777-7777-7777-777777777777/unblock

### Unblocking a card that isn't blocked fails with 422
POST http://localhost:8083/api/v1/customers/22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222/cards/77777777-7777-7777-7777-777777777777/unblock
